  Software itself is not the thing being sold.

This restriction does not prohibit:

a. internal use of the Software by a commercial organization;

b. consulting, research, development, or security services performed using
the Software, provided that the Software itself is not being sold as the
primary product;

c. independent software that merely interoperates with the Software without
incorporating substantial portions of it; or

d. other uses expressly authorized by BitHaven in writing.

If you are uncertain whether an intended use requires permission, contact
BitHaven before proceeding at BitHavenLLC@Gmail.com.

